title.en:
{
  translation: [PERSES] Please enjoy a moral drama / Crittin has something to say here! Tarwo Pittaya needs a Bai Si (traditional offering) and traditional songs, or he won't get cured!?
}

title.ko:
{
  translation: 【PERSES】도덕 드라마를 감상해 주세요／크리티인이 여기서 한마디 한다! 타우 피타야에게는 바이씨(※전통 제물)를 바치고 전통 노래를 들려줘야 낫는다고!?
}

title.id:
{
  translation: 【PERSES】Silakan nikmati drama moral / Krittin punya sesuatu untuk dikatakan di sini! Tawu Pittaya tidak akan sembuh kecuali dipersembahkan Baisi (*persembahan tradisional) dan diperdengarkan lagu tradisional!?
}

title.pt:
{
  translation: 【PERSES】Apreciem o drama moral / Krittin tem algo a dizer aqui! Taru Pittaya precisa de uma oferta Baci (*oferta tradicional) e de escutar músicas tradicionais para se curar!?
}
